WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:03,670
Impossible

2
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:09,020
There's no way he can see through me. We need to take a break. Goodbye.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,700
You go to bed early without disturbing me. Bye.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,180
It's better to stay away from Xie Jiao.

5
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:14,540
There's a lot of trouble around him

6
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,620
He has always said that he is related to the Xie family in the imperial capital

7
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,140
Never admit or deny

8
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:19,900
I was supposed to be alone in physical education class

9
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,060
There is a boy who rushes to team up with Xie Jiao

10
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,260
He also mocked Qianru

11
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,430
Qian Rucai teamed up with me

12
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,270
The people around him are particularly troublesome

13
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:33,180
This is the Xie family you are talking about. This is

14
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:36,020
Executor of the Xie Zhuo Zero 203 Team of the Imperial City Xie Family

15
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:41,100
Does Xie Zhuo know Xie Jiaojiao? Who doesn’t?

16
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,460
But it sounds familiar. Thank you.

17
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,340
Xie Zhuo is not allowed to make any more phone calls
